# Yttrium · Y · gate 39

**Yttrium** (Y) is element **39** of the periodic table — a **transition metal**, period 5, group 3, d-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **88.906**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
High-temperature superconductors; the red phosphor of the old picture tube; white LEDs.

